<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Ascom.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Ascom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Vontobel &amp; Co AG has issued two million American-style call warrants, on Ascom Holding AG bearer shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2400 CHF		  PREMIUM	35.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.60 CHF (INDICATIVE) GEARING	7.5 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.JUN.97-12.JAN.99   PAYDATE	16.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1960 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
